  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 25 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPositioned in a highly desirable pocket of Orewa, 46 Doment Crescent represents superb single level living. At the heart of the home sits a modern kitchen complete with stainless steel appliances and breakfast bar, making entertaining an absolute breeze.\r\n\r\nThe spacious open plan living area flows effortlessly onto a sun drenched deck and fully fenced backyard - ideal for safe play and relaxed alfresco dining.\r\n\r\nThe master suite includes an expansive walk-in wardrobe, an ensuite, and direct access through a ranch slider to the outdoor entertaining area. \r\n\r\nAn adjacent office provides a dedicated work-from-home setup or a flexible bonus space. Three additional generous bedrooms line the hall, serviced by a family bathroom with a bath and separate toilet.\r\n\r\nWith Orewa Beach, vibrant dining spots, supermarkets, parks and schools just a short walk away, this home is an exceptional find for families and investors alike. Don’t delay, call today!",
